              ),
              child: Icon(icon, size: 16, color: isSelected ? Colors.white : const Color(0xFF475569)),
            ),
            const SizedBox(width: 10),
            Text(
              label,
              style: GoogleFonts.outfit(
                fontWeight: isSelected ? FontWeight.w900 : FontWeight.w700,
